WEBVTT

00:02:58.758 --> 00:03:02.887
if this guy would agree not to file
an insurance claim and fix his car.

00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:06.349
And by the way, he has no idea
this is happening.

00:03:06.641 --> 00:03:08.851
He is completely in the dark.

00:03:08.851 --> 00:03:10.228
I started a blog,

00:03:10.228 --> 00:03:12.438
where I gave people
hourly updates -- yeah.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.481
(Laughter)

00:03:13.481 --> 00:03:16.609
It's beginning to dawn on you
what a bad idea this is, right?

00:03:16.651 --> 00:03:19.153
I started a blog, gave people updates,

00:03:19.195 --> 00:03:23.491
I got media inquires
from news programs, from NPR.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.412
I had a dream of rescuing
New Orleans by myself,

00:03:28.412 --> 00:03:29.914
(Laughter)

00:03:29.914 --> 00:03:32.458
with nothing more than my computer